{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>A second teru'ah.</b> The standard of Reuben journeys, and they blow no more, for the Kohathites and the priests with them who blow journey ahead of the standard of Ephraim." "<b>They shall blow a teru'ah.</b> The priests, for their journeys — for after the standard of Reuben they journey."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:58.976693766Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}